          "angle": 90
        },
        {
          "id": "left",
          "label": "left",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "value",
          "angle": 180
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "expandable-graph-rooms"
        },
        "markdown": "## Discussion Map\n\nFollow the semantic edges through the proposal:\n\n- a portal **motivates** a room-like expansion mode\n- the audience is **affected** by losing spatial context during navigation\n- the idea **assumes** mounted nodes can participate without changing ownership\n- evidence from portals, bridges, focus, and semantic zoom **supports** the model\n- the proposed mount contract **advances** the idea\n- the next step **tests** identity, saving, collapse, and cross-boundary edges\n\nThe governing principle is: **visually unified, operationally bounded.**"
      }
    },
